OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Russian president has been speaking
OL,8,Fto the media following the summit, and
OL,9,Fon the issue of Ukraine said that Kyiv
OL,10,Fand Europe were, in his words, not yet
OL,11,Fready to compromise to resolve the
OL,12,Fconflict
OL,14,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,15,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,16,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,17,Fthe moment here
OL,19,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,20,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,21,Fwar
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
